  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Mix flour, baking powder, and salt in a large bowl.",
    "Add coconut oil, water, roasted sesame seeds, and garlic powder. Mix until a sticky dough forms.",
    "Knead the dough for 5 minutes and let it rest for 10 minutes.",
    "Shape the dough into a round loaf and place it on a bamboo tray.",
    "Bake the bread for 30 minutes or until golden brown.",
    "Remove the bread from the oven and let it cool for 10 minutes.",
    "Slice the bread and serve warm."
